{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Pawsta</i></strong><i> is a <strong>cozy</strong> cooking game with cute <strong>claymation</strong>-style graphics. It stars <strong>Rigatoni</strong>, the mouse\ud83d\udc2d, as he travels the world over <strong>mastering</strong> cuisines &amp; collecting <strong>mice-alin stars</strong>!\u00a0</i>Make your <strong>Nonna </strong>proud by helping out your <strong>relatives </strong>at their <strong>international </strong>restaurants \ud83d\udc2d</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Cook from Scratch!\ud83c\udf45</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Learn </strong>to cook new cuisines<strong> from scratch</strong> by building them up step-by-step. Chop vegetables, roll out dough, and sprinkle in fresh herbs until the food is<strong> just right</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/rolling_dough.gif?t=1751376369\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Serve Cute Animal Guests!\ud83d\ude38</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take orders from a <strong>cute roster </strong>of <strong>animal </strong>patrons. Try to follow their orders as best as you can by choosing the right food ingredients. A <strong>happy customer </strong>can lead to great things!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/kitty.gif?t=1751376369\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fly Around the World!\ud83d\udee9\ufe0f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rigatoni has family all around the <strong>globe</strong>! Team up with your <strong>pilot</strong> friend <strong>Balto </strong>to travel the <strong>world </strong>and help out at their restaurants. It's <strong>your call </strong>where to go next, be it <strong>Brazil </strong>or <strong>Japan</strong>!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/flying_plane.gif?t=1751376369\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Master new cuisines! \ud83c\udf45</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock and <strong>master</strong> new <strong>cuisines</strong> from the <strong>countries</strong> you visit, including <strong>sushi</strong> in Japan! <strong>Impress</strong> enough guests &amp; you'll also learn how to do <strong>mice-alin</strong> special dishes!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/knife_sushi.gif?t=1751376369\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Meep!\ud83d\udc2d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Let loose a bit by <strong>&quot;meeping&quot;</strong> to your heart's content!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/meep.gif?t=1751376369\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">   </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">More to come\u00a0\ud83d\ude0b</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customise </strong>your look!\ud83e\udde2</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow a delightful family-driven story\u00a0\ud83d\udc9e</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade and change the <strong>cosmetics </strong>of your restaurants\u00a0\ud83c\udfa8</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlock </strong>new <strong>playable </strong>chefs\u00a0\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83c\udf73</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare <strong>Legendary Mice-alin</strong> dishes\u00a0\ud83c\udf71</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow cozy <strong>day-to-night</strong> service cycles\u00a0\ud83c\udf05</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore outside <strong>cozy</strong>\u00a0<strong>vistas</strong> and <strong>chat</strong> with the locals!<strong>\u00a0\ud83e\udd9d\ud83e\udd8a\ud83d\udc3c</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Buon appetito!</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3429190?t=1751376369","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3429190?t=1751376369","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/79433bc60b0a62bead53336392400cef9a189e08/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751376369","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/79433bc60b0a62bead53336392400cef9a189e08/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751376369","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Support Pawsta \ud83d\udc2d on Kickstarter! \ud83d\udc9a</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429190/extras/kickstarter_blurb.gif?t=1751376369\" /></div><strong>Pawsta</strong> \ud83d\udc2d is mostly being cooked up by <strong>1 person</strong> - <strong>Harry</strong>! He's backed by a lovely <strong>small team</strong> of cozy chefs, who he wants to bring on to <strong>help</strong> out more!\u00a0\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83c\udf73 <br> <br>To help <strong>achieve</strong> this, we've decided to run a <strong>Kickstarter</strong> <strong>campaign</strong> :)) Please consider looking it up &amp; pressing the big ol' <strong>notify</strong> <strong>button</strong> to <strong>hear</strong> when it <strong>launches</strong>! \u2728 <br> <br>Thank you, lovely person reading this!\u00a0\ud83d\udc96</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"b